	DisplayName: 生命掠夺鲨
	Tooltip:
		'''
		手持时提供[ScarletBuff/Terraria/Regeneration]、[ScarletBuff/Terraria/Ironskin]、[ScarletBuff/Terraria/Swiftness]和[ScarletBuff/Terraria/WellFed3]
		可开采[i:ContinentOfJourney/FinalOre]最终矿
